  m_Name: Alpha v0.3.0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  versionName: Alpha v0.3.0
  logcontent: '<b><size=120%>Added:</size></b>

    <size=85%>- Dynamic Amulet & Item
    system with 14 unique collectable amulets

    - Interactive Chest system with
    ChestCreator spawn manager

    - World interaction system (IInteractable) and
    Interact action (E key)

    - Amulet selection UI modal with interactive card
    drafting

    - Critical Strike Chance and Critical Damage mechanics

    -
    Luck stat affecting chest drop rates and loot opportunities

    - Centralized
    AmuletsDatabaseSO and runtime dynamic amulet generator

    - PlayerAmuletManager
    for dynamic stat modifications and passive buffs</size>


    <b><size=120%>Changed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>-
    Updated Player Stat Visualizer UI to display Crit Chance, Crit Damage, and Luck

    -
    Extended PlayerInputActions with world interaction binding</size>


    <b><size=120%>Fixed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>-
    Fixed fire rate stat calculation having inverted properties</size>'
